  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the textual material",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the text_chunk, as the meme's text directly addresses the viewer with a cruel, mocking statement ('just got his euthanasia forms signed, retard can't even read so i told him he got accepted into harvard lmfa'). The use of 'i' and 'you' (implied by the first-person narrative and the act of telling the child) creates a direct projection of the user's perspective onto the text, making the user the one who is 'telling' the joke and thus the one who is projecting their own hateful intent onto the scene. The text is the primary vehicle for this projection.",
